{"title":"2003 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the area of rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/d/40d540d1290bdbe754fa479a77f2209d1b5b7f43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 15 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 16 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 18 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 30 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Area\" title=\"Area\">area</a> of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rectangle\" title=\"Rectangle\">rectangle</a> is its width multiplied by its height. The width is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, while the height is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> have the same y-coordinate and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> have the same x-coordinate, finding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is straightforward:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/6/ad60cba9e8488af9bcba54288b23ac16fc7e14f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = 4 - (-1) = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"157\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/c/0cc5e06ecbfab3cf9ccc1ee21753601313a3159f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD = 5 - 2 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/5/90526395b6c4b609427db2046edfe6a2aa85983a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[ABCD] = BC \\times CD = 5 \\times 3 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"329\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017202431\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 56/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 410/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2432/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.764      1 Template:Image_needed\n100.00%    5.764      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:32602:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017202431 and revision id 251687. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}